ication Delivering high-quality fabrication and roofing solutions with precision, durability, and reliable workmanship for every project. Years of Experience 0 + Happy clients\u200b 0 + client\u200b Satisfaction 0 % LEARN MORE Why We Stand Out? Inside Amman Fabrication \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Amman Fabrication and Roofing specializes in high-quality roofing sheets, steel structures, and PEB solutions for industrial, commercial, and residential projects. With advanced machinery and skilled workmanship, we deliver reliable roofing, cladding, purlins, and structural fabrication with precision and efficiency. \u00a0 \u00a0 We manage manufacturing, fabrication, and installation under one roof, ensuring consistent quality, safe execution, and timely project completion. Our focus on durable materials, industry standards, and customer satisfaction makes us a dependable partner for roofing and structural solutions. Contact Us Commercial Projects 0 + Residential Projects 0 + Hardworking Employees 0 + Happy Customers\u200b 0 + What we offer? Our services and products Roofing ProductsRoofing Products Premium PPGI\/PPGL profile sheets, GI\/GL bare sheets, C &amp; Z purlins, decking sheets, and complete roofing accessories designed for high strength, durability, and weather resistance. Structural FabricationStructural Fabrication Precision fabrication of trusses, columns, beams, PEB structures, and heavy-duty industrial sheds using advanced cutting, welding, and forming technology for optimized structural performance. Installation &amp; FixingInstallation &amp; Fixing Expert installation of roofing and cladding systems with mechanized fixing, anchor fastening, sealant application, and structural alignment ensuring secure, leak-proof, and long-lasting performance. Reroofing &amp; MaintenanceReroofing &amp; Maintenance Technical re-roofing, waterproofing treatments, roof integrity inspection, load assessment, and quality audits to improve lifespan and maintain the structural safety of 